### 1. Check seeded inventory
GET http://localhost:8082/api/inventory/LAPTOP-PRO-14

### 2. Successful checkout
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-success-0001

{
  "customerId": "9cd71fd3-ab62-4d44-b564-f70f05d8af34",
  "paymentMethodToken": "tok_demo_success",
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "LAPTOP-PRO-14",
      "productName": "Pro Laptop 14",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1499.00
    },
    {
      "sku": "MOUSE-WL-02",
      "productName": "Wireless Mouse",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 29.50
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Payment failure / compensation path
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-failure-0001

{
  "customerId": "9cd71fd3-ab62-4d44-b564-f70f05d8af34",
  "paymentMethodToken": "fail_test_card",
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "MECH-KEY-01",
      "productName": "Mechanical Keyboard",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 89.00
    }
  ]
}

### Replace ORDER_ID from a create response
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/ORDER_ID

### Payment result
GET http://localhost:8083/api/payments/order/ORDER_ID

### Notification log
GET http://localhost:8084/api/notifications/order/ORDER_ID
